---
id: KelolaJenisDokumen-HapusJenisDokumen
title: Kelola Jenis Dokumen - Hapus Jenis Dokumen
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HR as HR/Super Admin
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant C as DocumentTypeController
    participant DT as DocumentType Model
    participant DB as Database

    HR->>UI: Klik tombol Hapus pada jenis dokumen tertentu
    UI->>UI: Tampilkan konfirmasi penghapusan
    HR->>UI: Klik tombol "Hapus" pada dialog konfirmasi
    UI->>C: DELETE /admin/document-types/{id}
    note over C: Cek: apakah masih ada dokumen pegawai dengan tipe ini?
    C->>DT: Check if document type has documents
    DT->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM worker_documents WHERE document_type_id = ?
    DB-->>DT: Count
    alt Tidak ada dokumen
        DT->>DB: DELETE FROM document_types WHERE id = ?
        DB-->>DT: Jenis dokumen berhasil dihapus
        DT-->>C: Confirmation
        C-->>UI: Response sukses
        UI-->>HR: Notifikasi penghapusan berhasil
    else Ada dokumen
        DT-->>C: Error - has documents
        C-->>UI: Response error
        UI-->>HR: Tampilkan pesan error: "Tidak dapat menghapus jenis dokumen yang masih digunakan"
    end

